{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.poster.avif?t=1766649466\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.webm?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.mp4?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6ab178ddeaaf575d2cdd0283c49c98c5.avif?t=1766649466\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a lone ship run\u2014it\u2019s <strong>fleet deployment and tactical decision-making</strong>. Let the AI handle routine combat, or take manual control to focus fire and reposition for an edge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation &amp; positioning</strong> shape your damage coverage and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target focus</strong> changes the pace of fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight when you must\u2014retreat when you should</strong> (getting home is part of winning)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.poster.avif?t=1766649466\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.webm?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.mp4?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.poster.avif?t=1766649466\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.webm?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.mp4?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d5f5702db10be1bf25d12c6da6f105f5.avif?t=1766649466\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite resource strategy: salvage, rebuild, repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sortie is a gamble. Routes, battles, and encounters come with different rewards and costs. Winning isn\u2019t enough\u2014you must manage <strong>expenses, attrition, and salvage value</strong>, because what you bring back is how you grow stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Module builds</strong>: swap better modules on the spot\u2014power spikes you can feel immediately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route gambling</strong>: safer paths offer stability; riskier ones can yield rarer modules and bigger payouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut your losses</strong>: retreating is a strategy\u2014but deductions are real, and the settlement will tell the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.poster.avif?t=1766649466\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.webm?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.mp4?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/8868c9b64d2551b890edf62772e2fa78.avif?t=1766649466\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark humor, written into the rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy\u2019s glory belongs to \u201ccivilization.\u201d The mess is for field agents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You\u2019ll face absurd incidents, faction politics, and corporate bureaucracy\u2014where dark humor isn\u2019t just dialogue, it\u2019s the system itself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you think you\u2019ve \u201cpaused\u201d\u2026 and it turns out you just triggered another procedure and another cost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you win the battle\u2026 then watch your earnings get sliced before they reach your pocket</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the enemy isn\u2019t only enemy fire. It\u2019s also the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.poster.avif?t=1766649466\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.webm?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.mp4?t=1766649466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One-line gameplay loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a contract \u2192 choose how to handle encounters \u2192 salvage &amp; recycle \u2192 refit your fleet \u2192 return, settle the bill, and head out again for bigger risks and bigger rewards.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129930?t=1766649466","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129930?t=1766649466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/a0aa875611896139eb90b9eb53ed941b009482d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766649466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/a0aa875611896139eb90b9eb53ed941b009482d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766649466","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Pain caused by common space diseases and drugs used to treat them. Psychological problems caused by social pressure and common means of counseling. Financial related illegal acts and their legal consequences. These topics are addressed in the story, but not directly in the gameplay."},"demos":[{"appid":3710200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.poster.avif?t=176664946